 "description": "Keyframed body motion for Annie, posed on an IK control rig (arm / leg IK, COG, spine bend, head aim, finger curl / spread controls) in Blender and baked to the humanoid bones: idles in a relaxed contrapposto, one-shot fidgets, listening loops, Jev's semantic gestures, talk-rest holds and a co-speech gesture phrase library (layer 'gesture', with prep / stroke / retract markers). Every clip is collision-checked on the deformed avatar mesh as shown (AvatarSample_B without the varsity jacket: hands, fingers and arms never inside the skin, crop top, skirt, thighs or hair; resting arms lightly touch the waist and skirt) and corrected by pushing the arm IK targets out, temporally smoothed. Gestures and fidgets start and end on the idle base pose; the dance is 120 bpm with its dips on 0.25 + 0.5 k s (demo/beat.py).",
